{"id":"84062f4afec5c913","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-porter.md","title":"Porter Space (local alias for a Stone space)","display":"df-porter — Porter Space (local alias for a Stone space)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-porter","aliases":["58-df-porter"],"display":"df-porter — Porter Space (local alias for a Stone space)","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[58-df-open-cover]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-porter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-porter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-porter — Porter Space (local alias for a Stone space)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"219f53fb10f5fa92\" href=\"?note=219f53fb10f5fa92\" title=\"58-df-open-cover\">58-df-open-cover</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b49399dd5e084e77\" href=\"?note=b49399dd5e084e77\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S\\)</span> (open-cover predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"219f53fb10f5fa92\" href=\"?note=219f53fb10f5fa92\" title=\"58-df-open-cover\">58-df-open-cover</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S\\)</span> (clopen-base predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b49399dd5e084e77\" href=\"?note=b49399dd5e084e77\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Porter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Porter}_S\\)</span> (local Stone-space predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}porter} \\vdash \\mathrm{Porter}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\bigl(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\bigr)\\land \\bigl(\\forall C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\to\\exists D\\subseteq C\\;(|D|&lt;\\omega\\land\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(D,X,\\tau)))\\bigr)\\land \\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}porter} \\vdash \\mathrm{Porter}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\bigl(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\bigr)\\land \\bigl(\\forall C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\to\\exists D\\subseteq C\\;(|D|&lt;\\omega\\land\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(D,X,\\tau)))\\bigr)\\land \\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Porter space” is treated here as a local alias, not as standard terminology.</li>\n<li>The displayed property is the standard Stone/Boolean-space condition: compact, Hausdorff, with a clopen base.</li>\n<li>The Stone–Čech compactification <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\omega\">\\(\\beta\\omega\\)</span> of discrete <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> satisfies this condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-open-cover","status":"resolved","id":"219f53fb10f5fa92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-open-cover]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base.md","status":"resolved","id":"b49399dd5e084e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate; see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-open-cover","status":"resolved","id":"219f53fb10f5fa92","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S$ (open-cover predicate; see [[58-df-open-cover]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base.md","status":"resolved","id":"b49399dd5e084e77","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S$ (clopen-base predicate; see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Porter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}porter} \\vdash \\mathrm{Porter}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\bigl(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\bigr)\\land \\bigl(\\forall C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\to\\exists D\\subseteq C\\;(|D|<\\omega\\land\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(D,X,\\tau)))\\bigr)\\land \\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1544,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-966","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-porter.md|58-df-porter]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","219f53fb10f5fa92","b49399dd5e084e77"]}